_id":"KChronoKnight/Chrono-Save-for-Civitai","ver":"26602b06d295dc26613ea3a4a15f93c99a356951","Node name for S&R":"ChronoSaveForCivit","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"7.8"}},"widgets_values":["%Y-%m-%d_Civitai","Zimage/%Y-%m-%d/Civitai/","png",100,false,true,true,""]},{"id":100,"type":"Note","pos":[-1846.9405180098252,-394.9727026427062],"size":[538.3333333333335,746.3333333333334],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"WorkFlow Notes","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["Description\n\nA lightweight utility workflow for fast, high-quality background removal using BiRefNet.\n\nDesigned to create transparent PNG assets for image editing, compositing, advertising, thumbnails, and AI workflows.\n\nVersion 1.0\n\nFeatures\n\n✓ One-click background removal\n✓ Transparent PNG output\n✓ Original resolution preserved\n✓ Optional image upscaling\n✓ BiRefNet Portrait model\n✓ Chrono Save for CivitAI\n✓ Lightweight workflow\n✓ No prompt required\n\n\nCommon Uses\n\n• Product photography\n• Character cut-outs\n• Sticker creation\n• YouTube thumbnails\n• Advertising assets\n• Composite workflows\n• AI image editing\n• PNG asset generation\n\nOptional Upscaling\n\nAn optional upscaling node is included for users who want higher-resolution PNG assets. Disable or bypass it to preserve the original image resolution.\n\nQuick Start\n\n1. Load an image.\n2. (Optional) Configure the upscaler.\n3. Click Run.\n4. Your transparent PNG is automatically saved.\n\nThat's it.\n\nNote\n\nOn the first run, the BiRefNet model will be downloaded automatically if it isn't already installed.\n"],"color":"#323","bgcolor":"#535"}],"links":[[117,1,0,97,0,"IMAGE"],[118,98,1,97,2,"INT"],[119,98,2,97,3,"INT"],[120,97,0,99,0,"IMAGE"],[121,2,0,101,0,"IMAGE"],[122,101,0,97,0,"IMAGE"]],"groups":[{"id":1,"title":"Process Image - Remove Background","b